   * resolved to a code (see `useWizardDraft.readDraft`'s normalizer) — in
   * that unconfirmed case `country` still carries the raw text so the
   * combobox can prompt the user to confirm rather than silently blanking a
   * required field. Deliberately no separate verdict/validity field: validity
   * is recomputed at read time from the geo-dataset shard cache, never
   * persisted (a persisted verdict would go stale across legacy drafts,
