   * country-changed-after-region edit, or a dataset regen).
   */
  countryCode: string;
  /**
   * ISO region/subdivision code for a list-picked region, or `null` when the
   * user instead typed free text into `region` (no code was ever resolved) —
   * distinguishing "picked from the list" from "typed, unconfirmed" the same
   * way `countryCode === ""` does for country.
   */
  regionCode: string | null;
  // Objective
  objectiveCategory: string;
  objective: string;
  // Factions
  factions: WizardFactionDraft[];
  /**
   * Context documents the instructor attached in the Context step. During
   * creation there is no exercise_id, so these are collected as pending
   * references in the draft and attached AFTER CreateExercise by the launch
   * hook (mirroring the faction/baseline post-create loop). Each entry is the
   * exact AttachContextDocumentRequest the range-bff attach endpoint expects.
   */
  contextDocuments: AttachContextDocumentRequest[];
  // Analysis
  analysisDone: boolean;
  /**
   * Client-minted UUID linking this draft to its PMESII environment analysis
   * (issue #479). Minted on the first Run in StepAnalysis, re-used verbatim by
   * Re-run/Retry (the backend resets the row), and forwarded as
   * `analysis_draft_id` on the create POST so the analysis attaches to the
   * exercise. Absent until the analysis has been run at least once.
   */
  analysisDraftId?: string;
  /**
   * Client-minted UUID linking this draft to its AI faction discovery
   * (setup-faction-discovery). Minted on the first Discover run in StepFactions,
   * re-used verbatim on re-runs, and forwarded as `draft_id` to the discovery
   * endpoint. Absent until discovery has been run at least once.
   */
  factionDiscoveryDraftId?: string;
  /**
