 * entered here" and skips every guided step, so anything the user did in the
 * wizard before switching to manual — baseline outlets, subreddits, drafted
 * factions, location, objective, the PMESII analysis, context documents,
 * timeline mode — must NOT reach the backend. Without this projection the
 * launch hook still fires the post-create side effects (BatchEnableWebsites,
 * CreateFaction, attach) for that abandoned state.
